00:41:20.740 --> 00:41:29.920
I can't help it if they take the wireless cups and the mobile suit.

00:42:02.650 --> 00:42:04.620
Robert, are you alright?

00:42:04.620 --> 00:42:06.010
I'm sorry...

00:42:06.010 --> 00:42:07.090
I'm going to escape.

00:42:11.050 --> 00:42:12.900
Robert, don't be late.

00:42:12.900 --> 00:42:18.210
My house...

00:42:18.210 --> 00:42:29.350
Won't you come with me?

00:42:31.720 --> 00:42:33.750
I will go. I hate the forward units.

00:42:33.750 --> 00:42:35.940
I hate the Titans more than anything else.

00:42:35.940 --> 00:42:39.260
All right. In that case, follow me with all your might.

00:42:39.260 --> 00:42:41.340
The Titans' pursuit team will be here soon.

00:42:41.340 --> 00:42:50.240
Because it was a reconnaissance aircraft,

00:42:50.240 --> 00:42:53.360
I went out to attack without carrying weapons.

00:42:53.360 --> 00:42:56.430
Of course, the pilot of Unit 3 is not GERIDO.

00:42:56.430 --> 00:42:58.410
I don't understand that you're a different person.

00:42:58.410 --> 00:43:00.000
What's GERIDO like?

00:43:00.860 --> 00:43:06.350
Colonel Baskholm, why were you working on the Gundam Mk-II here?

00:43:06.350 --> 00:43:10.400
If you had been working on the Green Noir II, you wouldn't have had to do all the damage to your home base.

00:43:10.400 --> 00:43:20.060
Leave it alone, keep quiet about the general information!

00:43:20.060 --> 00:43:22.410
This is the base of the Charns!

00:43:22.410 --> 00:43:25.340
It's a different way of doing things than the Federation Army of the West!

00:43:25.340 --> 00:43:29.700
Even so, it doesn't change the fact that we're in the same Federation Army!

00:43:30.440 --> 00:43:37.290
This is a central base to pass the E.U.G. to carry out the anti-Earth government movement with the leadership of Zeon.

00:43:37.810 --> 00:43:41.470
Can you think about the convenience of the space Noid of the colony of the invaders and make a strategy?

00:43:42.260 --> 00:43:47.120
The more we advance, the more we advance, the more we will raise the anti-Earth Federation government organization.

00:43:47.780 --> 00:43:49.480
Why can't you understand that?

00:43:50.510 --> 00:43:51.610
Shut up, I'm telling you!

00:43:55.410 --> 00:44:00.000
I said this is the Starnes, but the Japanese military law does not apply.

00:44:00.000 --> 00:44:02.000
What are you saying, raising a child?

00:44:02.000 --> 00:44:04.270
The general public is silent!

00:44:25.910 --> 00:44:27.890
There is a patrol car waiting for you.

00:44:27.890 --> 00:44:30.000
Good.

00:44:30.000 --> 00:44:31.420
Do you think you can catch it?

00:44:31.420 --> 00:44:32.590
Are you OK?

00:44:32.590 --> 00:44:34.850
Yes, I'm OK.

00:44:34.850 --> 00:44:43.110
There is a big hole.

00:44:43.110 --> 00:44:44.050
Don't touch it.

00:44:44.050 --> 00:44:49.030
Samko, let it go.

00:44:49.030 --> 00:44:50.030
Follow me later.

00:44:50.030 --> 00:44:50.950
Yes, sir.

00:45:33.000 --> 00:45:35.810
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

00:45:35.810 --> 00:45:44.680
I want to complete the task as a pilot.

00:45:44.680 --> 00:45:45.650
Shut up!

00:45:45.650 --> 00:45:48.060
Apolly, it's a signal bullet!

00:46:04.030 --> 00:46:07.260
"Why is that guy..."

00:46:07.260 --> 00:46:09.320
"5...4...3..."

00:46:30.000 --> 00:46:32.210
I can't hear you!

00:46:32.210 --> 00:46:35.830
Can you hear me?

00:46:35.830 --> 00:46:37.660
Is this the real Megaryu Shouka?

00:46:37.660 --> 00:46:41.040
What is this?

00:46:41.040 --> 00:46:48.070
It's the sound of the aircraft.

00:46:48.070 --> 00:46:56.950
Can you hear me?

00:46:56.950 --> 00:46:59.960
Yes, I can hear you.

00:47:22.430 --> 00:47:23.840
I'm not used to it.

00:49:13.790 --> 00:49:17.060
Emma Sheen from Returns came to Nagamaki.

00:49:17.060 --> 00:49:20.110
The letter she brought was a tragic one.

00:49:20.110 --> 00:49:23.300
Kamille was outraged and confused.

00:49:23.300 --> 00:49:29.110
This action shows the most tragic scene of Kamille.

00:49:29.110 --> 00:49:29.600
Next time.

00:49:30.000 --> 00:49:32.950
"The Super Saiyan Beta Gundam: Inside the Capsule"

00:49:32.950 --> 00:49:39.320
"You are the Tear of Time"

00:49:39.320 --> 00:49:41.200
"This program is..."

00:49:41.200 --> 00:49:46.250
"It's not a destiny, but I won't give up"

00:49:46.250 --> 00:49:49.250
"Because I'm awake now"

00:49:49.250 --> 00:49:54.250
"The burning throbbing is the light of the times"

00:49:54.250 --> 00:49:59.920
"The flame that shines in the dark"

00:51:00.120 --> 00:51:04.070
Inside the capsule...

00:51:04.070 --> 00:51:07.070
Luna-2

00:51:07.070 --> 00:51:14.020
It is a small planet transported from the asteroid belt to mine the rock used in space colonies.

00:51:14.020 --> 00:51:21.700
Currently, it is used as an all-terrain base of the Earth Federation Army near the Green Oasis.

00:51:41.070 --> 00:51:43.480
I don't know.

00:51:43.480 --> 00:51:46.060
It's getting hot.

00:51:46.060 --> 00:51:51.400
The unit we're chasing now has set up a mobile suit for Grips.

00:51:51.400 --> 00:51:55.080
Laila, Miralaila, can't you do something about the fire?

00:51:55.080 --> 00:51:58.090
Then I want you to get rid of your anxiety.

00:51:58.090 --> 00:52:00.000
I can do it.

00:52:00.000 --> 00:52:02.000
I'm sure you'll get the unit.

00:52:02.730 --> 00:52:03.730
I hope so, too.

00:52:13.800 --> 00:52:15.100
I'm coming in, Colonel Wright.

00:52:18.460 --> 00:52:20.920
I'm sorry to have you come to the Glyphs.

00:52:21.320 --> 00:52:22.850
It's my duty.

00:52:23.930 --> 00:52:25.430
This is my letter.

00:52:25.940 --> 00:52:28.770
Please deliver it to Captain Jamitov-Hyman directly.

00:52:28.850 --> 00:52:29.350
Yes, sir.

00:52:32.400 --> 00:52:33.360
What's wrong?

00:52:33.360 --> 00:52:34.390
Oh, nothing.

00:52:34.390 --> 00:52:36.370
I'll give it to you directly.

00:52:36.370 --> 00:52:37.540
Yes.

00:52:37.540 --> 00:52:39.390
Excuse me.

00:52:39.390 --> 00:52:42.370
What time is the ship?

00:52:42.370 --> 00:52:43.260
An hour later.

00:52:43.260 --> 00:52:45.330
Have a good trip.

00:52:45.330 --> 00:52:47.790
Thank you.

00:52:47.790 --> 00:52:50.540
What is it?

00:52:50.540 --> 00:52:56.640
It seems that the Lunar 2 unit has captured a suspect who seems to have launched a mobile suit.

00:52:56.640 --> 00:53:00.000
It is true that the Franklin team stole the Gundam Mark II.

00:53:00.000 --> 00:53:15.640
The name of the M-Type Amuro Ray is well known as Angra's public item.

00:53:15.640 --> 00:53:18.630
Oh, is it Angra in the Green Oasis?

00:53:18.630 --> 00:53:22.500
The Green Oasis wasn't originally a military base.

00:53:22.500 --> 00:53:27.290
That's right, but what if the air leak continues?

00:53:27.290 --> 00:53:30.000
With your cooperation, two mobile phones...

00:53:30.000 --> 00:53:32.890
I don't think I'll be able to do this normally either.

00:53:32.890 --> 00:53:36.090
It's just a coincidence.

00:53:36.090 --> 00:53:37.230
Hahaha.

00:53:37.230 --> 00:53:41.050
I want to believe that that coincidence is also due to the power of humans.

00:53:41.050 --> 00:53:45.290
I'm a Quattro unit.

00:53:45.290 --> 00:53:46.690
Hm? Yuk?

00:53:46.690 --> 00:53:48.000
Did you come out?

00:53:48.000 --> 00:53:49.050
Probably.

00:53:49.050 --> 00:53:50.320
Alright.

00:53:50.320 --> 00:53:52.650
Ensign Nekoa.

00:53:52.650 --> 00:53:53.540
I'm counting on you, Kamille.

00:53:53.540 --> 00:53:55.520
Yes, I'm from the FLEX.

00:53:55.520 --> 00:53:56.520
Are you an enemy?

00:53:56.520 --> 00:53:58.020
That's right.

00:53:58.020 --> 00:54:00.000
It's currently being deployed in this area.

00:54:00.000 --> 00:54:03.990
We're the only ones who can do it, so we don't have to do anything else.

00:54:03.990 --> 00:54:07.660
Laila, Iina, stop your feet and try to get down.

00:54:07.660 --> 00:54:09.570
The purpose is not to sink you.

00:54:09.570 --> 00:54:11.060
I know.

00:54:11.060 --> 00:54:13.060
Do you think he's a war-lover?

00:54:13.060 --> 00:54:14.830
Hmph, I don't think so.

00:54:14.830 --> 00:54:17.780
Well then, let's meet your expectations one day.

00:54:25.960 --> 00:54:27.880
Am I expecting too much?

00:54:27.880 --> 00:54:29.540
I want to think of him as a new type.

00:54:30.380 --> 00:54:32.050
What do you think about the Quattro unit?

00:54:32.050 --> 00:54:34.390
The Newtype is not an Esper.

00:54:34.390 --> 00:54:39.540
So, I don't see any difference in appearance, but I can feel its quality.

00:54:39.540 --> 00:54:40.600
I think so.

00:54:40.600 --> 00:54:41.940
Please take good care of it.

00:54:41.940 --> 00:54:49.330
Astronaut.

00:54:49.330 --> 00:54:53.080
You're making a battleship for Grips' dog, right?

00:54:53.080 --> 00:54:54.090
What kind of battleship is it?

00:54:54.090 --> 00:54:55.670
I don't know.

00:54:55.670 --> 00:54:57.430
It seems to be a pretty good one.

00:54:57.430 --> 00:55:00.000
Copy Grips' data and keep the numbers.

00:55:00.540 --> 00:55:02.490
There is a strong possibility that it will become a battle.

00:55:02.490 --> 00:55:03.660
Huh?

00:55:03.660 --> 00:55:04.640
Did you get caught?

00:55:04.640 --> 00:55:07.630
From the time it came, the Lunar 2's troops have been deployed.

00:55:07.630 --> 00:55:08.540
We are...

00:55:08.540 --> 00:55:09.710
That's right.

00:55:09.710 --> 00:55:11.750
Kaminyu-kun.

00:55:11.750 --> 00:55:13.500
What?

00:55:13.500 --> 00:55:14.450
Captain Squatro.

00:55:14.450 --> 00:55:19.250
Do you know that a battleship is being built in Grips?

00:55:19.250 --> 00:55:21.160
In Green Noir 2?

00:55:21.160 --> 00:55:23.720
I know, but the contents are completely...

00:55:23.720 --> 00:55:24.640
I guess so.

00:55:24.640 --> 00:55:30.000
The data that the Gundam Mk2's armor is the same as before has come out, but is it true?

00:55:30.440 --> 00:55:33.030
Yes, that's what my mother said.

00:55:33.030 --> 00:55:34.110
Your mother?

00:55:34.110 --> 00:55:37.720
Yes, because my mother is an expert in material engineering.

00:55:37.720 --> 00:55:43.260
She said that the Gundam Mk-II would use new armor for the next mobile suit.

00:55:43.260 --> 00:55:46.040
So the Mk-II is still the Mk-II after all.

00:55:46.040 --> 00:55:51.960
About that, it seems that the company will actively incorporate Zeon's technology.

00:56:18.270 --> 00:56:21.890
I'm not sure if I can see it yet.

00:56:21.890 --> 00:56:24.260
It seems that Kimura has also confirmed the attack ship.

00:56:24.260 --> 00:56:27.070
What are you going to do, Captain?

00:56:27.070 --> 00:56:30.000
I don't like it. The course is not interesting.

00:56:30.000 --> 00:56:34.900
This ship will descend to the south of Green Oasis and head for Earth.

00:56:34.900 --> 00:56:37.320
Hmm. What's up, Captain?

00:56:37.320 --> 00:56:40.390
Ah, we're going to return to Green Oasis.

00:56:40.390 --> 00:56:43.740
I see. Which one?

00:56:43.740 --> 00:56:47.640
We'll avoid Luna 2 from Green Oasis. We won't take the initial course.

00:56:47.640 --> 00:56:51.700
That way, we won't be caught by the fleet around Green Oasis.

00:56:51.700 --> 00:56:55.220
That's right. There is a risk along the way.

00:57:05.820 --> 00:57:08.820
If you only look at the mobile suit, you won't be able to see anything.

00:57:08.820 --> 00:57:11.820
We might be able to find enemy armor at the site.

00:57:11.820 --> 00:57:14.820
Are you telling us to search the room from above?

00:57:14.820 --> 00:57:16.740
That's the order from Captain Musk.

00:57:16.740 --> 00:57:20.150
Captain, Captain Franklin and Captain Hilda have appeared.

00:57:20.150 --> 00:57:24.310
Alright, Alexandria is taking off. Open the gate!

00:57:24.310 --> 00:57:26.790
Are you Kamiyu's subordinates?

00:57:26.790 --> 00:57:29.280
Look, Brex.

00:58:00.000 --> 00:58:00.640
I got it.

00:58:00.640 --> 00:58:01.810
It's a small ship.

00:58:02.810 --> 00:58:05.400
It's coming to us often.

00:58:05.400 --> 00:58:09.360
That ship?

00:58:10.570 --> 00:58:12.570
That ship doesn't have a main ship.

00:58:12.570 --> 00:58:15.000
Is there a ship that was built in front of the ship?

00:58:21.490 --> 00:58:22.080
You may leave.

00:58:22.080 --> 00:58:23.080
Ready to launch.

00:58:23.080 --> 00:58:27.580
Air traffic signal?

00:58:30.000 --> 00:58:31.860
I heard they don't believe in us moving the army.

00:58:31.860 --> 00:58:34.130
It's because we're not the BUSC of the BRICS.

00:58:34.130 --> 00:58:36.270
The Galvaladins are coming.

00:58:36.270 --> 00:58:38.930
We're ready.

00:58:38.930 --> 00:58:40.760
The 4th Division?

00:58:40.760 --> 00:58:43.000
The Quattro Division.

00:58:43.000 --> 00:58:44.990
The Rigdias is on standby.

00:58:44.990 --> 00:58:49.050
Make sure they can leave anytime.

00:58:49.050 --> 00:58:49.840
Don't slow down.

00:59:00.000 --> 00:59:01.000
"You're fast"

00:59:01.000 --> 00:59:05.140
"I won't lower my speed"

00:59:10.750 --> 00:59:13.670
"Don't think a battleship can beat a Mobile Suit"

00:59:16.680 --> 00:59:20.090
"Here I go"

00:59:20.090 --> 00:59:22.090
"Don't shoot until you have orders"

00:59:22.090 --> 00:59:25.380
"Galvalti?"

00:59:25.380 --> 00:59:28.720
"It's Luna 2's Bosnian-class Galvalti"

00:59:28.720 --> 00:59:30.000
"It might come out"

00:59:30.000 --> 00:59:33.920
Wait a minute! I don't want to be the one to lead the way!

00:59:33.920 --> 00:59:36.920
Can you hear me? Make it clear that you are under the command of the commander.

00:59:36.920 --> 00:59:40.810
If you don't obey our orders, you will be executed!

00:59:40.810 --> 00:59:45.330
We are E.U.U.G.O.! You cannot obey our orders!

00:59:45.330 --> 00:59:48.330
Roger that. You will be executed.

00:59:50.360 --> 00:59:52.980
I'll do it!

00:59:52.980 --> 00:59:56.370
Over there!

00:59:56.370 --> 01:00:00.000
What the hell is that?

01:00:01.500 --> 01:00:03.200
Mobile Suit type, take off!

01:00:10.840 --> 01:00:15.040
Is it true that Kamille stole the Gundam Mk-II?

01:00:15.500 --> 01:00:17.190
There's no way I'd know.

01:00:17.830 --> 01:00:19.850
You're always like that.

01:00:20.560 --> 01:00:22.320
You only think about yourself.

01:00:24.950 --> 01:00:26.790
I'm thinking about Bask right now.

01:00:27.460 --> 01:00:30.000
I'm aware that this situation is strange.

01:00:30.120 --> 01:00:31.330
What do you think?

01:00:31.330 --> 01:00:34.720
Margarita is thinking about a young woman, isn't she?

01:00:34.720 --> 01:00:35.730
Damn it!

01:00:35.730 --> 01:00:40.840
This is a normal suit for pilots, isn't it?

01:00:40.840 --> 01:00:42.770
Is it okay for me to wear it?

01:00:42.770 --> 01:00:44.200
It can't be helped, right?

01:00:44.200 --> 01:00:47.510
This is the only thing left here.

01:00:47.510 --> 01:00:50.390
There is a net attachment on the handle.

01:00:50.390 --> 01:00:51.890
What?

01:00:51.890 --> 01:00:54.700
Then turn it forward.

01:00:54.700 --> 01:00:59.350
Then I can fight as a pilot.

01:01:00.120 --> 01:01:04.000
If you're going to fight in uniform, it won't be that easy, will it?

01:01:04.000 --> 01:01:05.690
But I...

01:01:05.690 --> 01:01:10.050
It's okay. You're here. You were on the floor earlier.

01:01:10.050 --> 01:01:11.490
Let's sleep!

01:02:00.570 --> 01:02:03.320
I'll take care of it. I'll take care of it during this time.

01:02:03.320 --> 01:02:05.030
Report the situation of the attack.

01:02:05.030 --> 01:02:09.410
Are you okay?

01:02:09.410 --> 01:02:23.820
It's a strange stage.

01:02:23.820 --> 01:02:24.900
It's a signal.

01:02:31.980 --> 01:02:34.070
A withdrawal order has been issued from Rosmia.

01:02:34.070 --> 01:02:38.310
That red Mobile Suit has been put on it.

01:02:38.310 --> 01:02:44.170
If we don't have any other support, we won't be able to fight.

01:02:44.170 --> 01:02:50.650
Edei has been killed.

01:02:50.650 --> 01:02:51.770
I know.

01:02:51.770 --> 01:02:53.870
Do you think I didn't see it?

01:02:53.870 --> 01:02:54.730
No.

01:02:54.730 --> 01:02:56.960
I want to think that the red crystal was my opponent.

01:02:56.960 --> 01:02:59.320
If I don't go out, I won't be able to fight.

01:03:06.940 --> 01:03:11.610
Captain Quattro took a step back.

01:03:11.610 --> 01:03:13.230
Can't we make a move?

01:03:13.230 --> 01:03:15.340
We'll take the second wave in the future.

01:03:15.340 --> 01:03:17.200
Let's expect Captain Quattro.

01:03:17.200 --> 01:03:19.790
Get ready to repair the machine room.

01:03:19.790 --> 01:03:22.420
Too quick to make a decision.

01:03:22.420 --> 01:03:24.600
What do you think, Captain?

01:03:24.600 --> 01:03:27.550
The mask that stopped us is coming out.

01:03:27.550 --> 01:03:29.560
On top of that, it will be the second wave.

01:03:38.570 --> 01:03:42.780
The command post will be opened when the next capsule enters your field of vision.

01:03:42.780 --> 01:03:47.060
The negotiation between you and Emma will begin in 15 minutes.

01:03:47.060 --> 01:03:51.160
Is that capsule a powerful bomb?

01:03:51.160 --> 01:03:53.750
That's about it.

01:03:53.750 --> 01:03:57.260
There are some that appear for the first time in High Dark,

01:03:57.260 --> 01:04:00.000
but I think it's a high-level training.

01:04:00.000 --> 01:04:03.000
The plan is to get back the Mark II.

01:04:03.000 --> 01:04:06.950
Tomorrow, I'll have someone else do the invitation, so I'll do it.

01:04:06.950 --> 01:04:22.020
What's the order?

01:04:22.840 --> 01:04:28.030
The one who kills the enemy, catch!

01:04:28.030 --> 01:04:30.000
So, what about the recovery of the first unit?

01:04:30.160 --> 01:04:31.160
It's over.

01:04:31.160 --> 01:04:32.160
That's fast.

01:04:32.160 --> 01:04:33.990
I'm ready to attack.

01:04:33.990 --> 01:04:35.990
It's a different form.

01:04:35.990 --> 01:04:42.080
Confirmed.

01:04:42.080 --> 01:04:43.080
What?

01:04:43.080 --> 01:04:44.190
Is it real?

01:04:44.190 --> 01:04:45.140
Is this the end?

01:04:45.140 --> 01:04:45.960
Yes.

01:04:45.960 --> 01:04:48.870
Confirmed the white flag.

01:04:48.870 --> 01:04:50.820
Is the nobile suit the white flag?

01:04:50.820 --> 01:04:56.510
Yes.

01:05:00.160 --> 01:05:01.160
What do you think?

01:05:01.160 --> 01:05:04.140
We need to save time.

01:05:04.140 --> 01:05:05.450
Let's accept it.

01:05:05.450 --> 01:05:08.370
The main engine of Azama is going to be fixed.

01:05:11.850 --> 01:05:25.600
What's going on?

01:05:30.000 --> 01:05:32.240
I brought a suit of mobile suit.

01:05:32.240 --> 01:05:35.060
If there is anyone approaching this mobile suit,

01:05:35.060 --> 01:05:37.240
that high-dose will shoot.

01:05:37.240 --> 01:05:39.240
I came in alone.

01:05:39.240 --> 01:05:40.240
Is it a mobile suit?

01:05:40.240 --> 01:05:41.160
It's a Gundam.

01:05:41.160 --> 01:05:41.980
Chimoki, Chimoki.

01:05:41.980 --> 01:05:42.980
There are a lot of people.

01:05:42.980 --> 01:05:44.930
Because it's Sterns.

01:05:44.930 --> 01:05:45.750
