01:57:32.270 --> 01:57:39.240
I'm going to be a father to an adult who is a true parent like Emma Chui.

01:57:39.240 --> 01:57:43.370
But your parents are...

01:57:43.370 --> 01:57:48.010
I'm not that kind of parent!

01:57:48.010 --> 01:57:50.350
Can't you say that?

01:57:50.350 --> 01:57:55.020
But I wanted my parents to be parents.

01:57:55.020 --> 01:57:56.720
Can't you say that?

01:57:56.720 --> 01:57:58.400
A child is...

01:57:58.400 --> 01:58:00.000
I've been a lover for a long time.

01:58:00.000 --> 01:58:04.790
and my mother made my father a lover and I was satisfied with my job.

01:58:04.790 --> 01:58:06.680
I didn't even look at my father like that.

01:58:06.680 --> 01:58:09.800
Is military work that important?

01:58:09.800 --> 01:58:13.310
It's not like that with Eugo or Charles.

01:58:13.310 --> 01:58:17.050
I don't like it when my children are ignored.

01:58:17.050 --> 01:58:19.650
I understand, but...

01:58:19.650 --> 01:58:23.260
Don't talk about your dead parents.

01:58:23.260 --> 01:58:24.280
That's right.

01:58:24.280 --> 01:58:29.830
And I have to make a night for the children of the next generation.

01:58:30.160 --> 01:58:32.150
You don't have such a responsibility, do you?

01:58:32.150 --> 01:58:33.300
Yes, I do.

01:58:33.300 --> 01:58:35.890
My duty is my responsibility.

01:58:35.890 --> 01:58:39.080
I was killed twice in front of you.

01:58:39.080 --> 01:58:42.080
I don't have the right to say anything to you.

01:58:42.080 --> 01:58:46.350
Do you know a person called Char Aznable?

01:58:46.350 --> 01:58:49.620
I respect him.

01:58:49.620 --> 01:58:54.680
He is the one who carried the pain of his parents and tried to defeat the Zabi family.

01:58:54.680 --> 01:58:59.670
But he was defeated by the organization alone.

01:59:00.250 --> 01:59:02.440
He's an idiot.

01:59:02.440 --> 01:59:04.660
That's an accurate statement.

01:59:04.660 --> 01:59:07.780
But, from what you said,

01:59:07.780 --> 01:59:10.280
I think I can hear what he's saying.

01:59:10.280 --> 01:59:12.240
Quattrotai?

01:59:12.240 --> 01:59:13.740
There's no way I can meet him.

01:59:13.740 --> 01:59:18.420
That person is very similar to Kamiyu-kun's position.

01:59:18.420 --> 01:59:21.330
He expressed his personal feelings,

01:59:21.330 --> 01:59:26.480
and I felt that it was the most important thing to break through the situation.

01:59:26.480 --> 01:59:28.730
I can't hear you.

01:59:28.730 --> 01:59:29.700
For me,

01:59:30.120 --> 01:59:33.230
I told you that I have nothing to do with your mother and Chitanzu, right?

01:59:33.230 --> 01:59:37.360
They're stupid parents who died in the clutches of grown-ups.

01:59:37.360 --> 01:59:41.230
But no, they were my parents!

01:59:41.230 --> 01:59:44.420
Kamiya-kun!

01:59:44.420 --> 01:59:52.940
I don't think it's right to persuade him like that.

01:59:52.940 --> 02:00:00.000
You're the only one who knows who you are.

02:00:00.000 --> 02:00:03.080
There is a bad habit that makes you want to take it.
